file mantra/src/store.rye the repair -- max_blob_bytes named and derived, StoreError with BlobTooLarge and BlobNameMismatch, the ceiling read at the write edge, the read moved to readFileAlloc under a limit one past it, and the digest recomputed and compared before the bytes are returned
file mantra/src/main.rye the port -- the CLI's second Store deleted and store.rye imported, 617 to 555 lines, its private hex_encode gone with it, the section comment naming why the port was declined once and what removed the reason
file mantra/src/store_witness.rye eight claims over a pen handed in by the caller, three refusals asserted by name, and a header saying which direction of the ceiling is proven and which is carried
file tools/m/mantra_store_witness.rish the guard -- it asserts the module still declares its ceiling and both errors, and that main.rye carries no second Store
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_store_control.sh seven phases, one innocence leg and six breaks, each plant checked by plant_apply; the break it cannot catch is named in the header
